    Supplementary-plane characters (code point > U+FFFF) sort before the BMP
    under the JCS rule; Python's ``sort_keys`` (code-point order) does not
    reproduce that, so the structure is sorted explicitly before dumping.
    """
    return tuple(ord(ch) if ord(ch) <= 0xFFFF else 0 for ch in key)


